#: previewer.cpp:280
msgid ""
"This size field shows how large the uncompressed image will be.\n"
"It tries to warn you, if you try to produce huge images by \n"
"changing its background color."
msgstr ""
"Este campo de tamaño mostra o grande que será a imaxe descomprimida.\n"
"Tentará avisalo, se tenta producir imaxe enormes, mudando a cor\n"
"de fondo."

